<title>BRAZIL: Brazil Senate OKs $200 mln CVRD loan deal.</title>
<headline>Brazil Senate OKs $200 mln CVRD loan deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Senate has approved a measure authorizing state mining giant Cia Vale do Rio Doce to receive a $200 million loan from Japanese-owned Nippon Amazon Aluminium Co, An official said.</p>
<p>A Senate spokesman said the loan, approved by a 33-7 vote, will be backed by the federal government.</p>
<p>The money will be used to help finance the company's Alunorte project.</p>
<p>-- James Craig, Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 248 5413</p>
</text>
